{"script":"wt_c4_07_1_n","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女阿碧约格","text":"[show]嗯嗯？你们手上可没有那个燃烧炼金炸弹呢！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女阿碧约格","text":"[show]要是没有炸弹的话……就没法安抚怨灵了！它们会造成更多的破坏的！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"巨木侍女阿碧约格","text":"[show]还请快一点哦，这事可不能拖！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"烧尽怨魂的爆炎"}